      "writtenOn": "2026-10-24T03:55:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The Apache `LICENSE` header published by Gerrit-CI is centered, so every line has leading spaces and `append(line)` keeps them. A CI plugin\u0027s `license` then becomes e.g. `\"            Apache License\\n      Version 2.0, January 2004\"`, while `CorePluginsRepository.GERRIT_LICENSE` is `\"Apache License\\nVersion 2.0, January 2004\"` with no indent — so the same license renders differently in the tooltip for core vs CI plugins. Strip to normalize:\n\n```java\nartifactBody.append(line.strip());\n```",
      "revId": "2f8d1f6990bfcdc67593e7bee40af39915985905",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
