      "message": "Happy-path covers a plugin that publishes a `LICENSE`, but none for one that doesn\u0027t, so the `@Nullable license` field and the `pluginLicense.orElse(null)` branch are uncovered. Add e.g.:\n\n```java\n@Test\npublic void artifactPublishedWithoutLicense_pluginLicenseShouldBeNull() throws IOException {\n  testBuildDetailJson.add(\n      \"artifacts\",\n      artifacts(TEST_PLUGIN_NAME + \".jar\", TEST_PLUGIN_NAME + \".jar-version\",\n          TEST_PLUGIN_NAME + \".json\"));\n  when(gsonMock.getReader(getArtifactUrl(TEST_PLUGIN_NAME + \".jar-version\")))\n      .thenReturn(readerOf(TEST_PLUGIN_VERSION_1_0));\n  when(gsonMock.get(getArtifactUrl(TEST_PLUGIN_NAME + \".json\")))\n      .thenReturn(SmartJson.of(Map.of(\"description\", TEST_PLUGIN_DESCRIPTION)));\n\n  PluginInfo plugin \u003d\n      new JenkinsCiPluginsRepository(Providers.of(gsonMock), configMock)\n          .list(TEST_GERRIT_VERSION).getFirst();\n\n  assertThat(plugin.license).isNull();\n}\n```",
      "revId": "2f8d1f6990bfcdc67593e7bee40af39915985905",
